02:14.390 --> 02:15.890
It's Malcolm's fault.

02:15.890 --> 02:17.560
That punk from Newark.

02:17.560 --> 02:21.000
He just went back to the hotel
without saying anything.

02:22.060 --> 02:25.730
There are plenty of Mongolian Chop squads.
On this planet...

02:25.730 --> 02:28.340
...they're one of those shitty
bands that don't make no money.

02:28.340 --> 02:29.670
They fucking suck.

02:31.240 --> 02:34.210
I saw the letter from
Uncle Davis by accident.

02:34.910 --> 02:36.250
I can't believe what I read.

02:36.250 --> 02:38.180
It said, "To Ryusuke Minami...

02:38.510 --> 02:41.180
The man who will inherit
the legend of Sonny Boy."

02:42.380 --> 02:44.550
My uncle says that to everybody.

02:44.550 --> 02:45.680
What?

02:49.360 --> 02:51.360
But it is the first time he says

02:51.360 --> 02:54.030
he actually is gonna hand
over the Lucille to them.

02:54.030 --> 02:56.200
That's a first.

02:56.200 --> 03:02.200
Recalling my torn broken,
aching heart of these long days.

03:02.200 --> 03:08.710
And all the memories I wanted
to forget for making leaps.

03:08.710 --> 03:14.880
Recalling, breaking, aching, crying,
making sure to me.

03:14.880 --> 03:23.810
And I take all and grin
at my future on the way.

